  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Mauritius&apos; accession to the OECD Working Group on Bribery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2022, Mauritius received permission from the OECD to begin steps to accede to the OECD Working Group on Bribery. MMDP funded a mock assessment of Mauritius&#x2019; readiness to accede, undertaken by independent experts with significant real world experience of the accession process, and delivered through GovRisk.

Implementing partner: GovRisk - the International Governance and Risk Institute</narrative>
  </description>
